      "target": "An **unengaged** **DAEMONETTES** unit of yours.",
      "effect": "Place the unit into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**. Should it come back by **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** in [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), during its Reinforcements step, you can set it up more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy unit, rather than more than 8\", if it is also placed wholly within 8\" of an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** unit of yours."
